<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-10-16T09:59:47.990Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 09:59:47 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraq's parliament approved the al-Zaidi cabinet amid growing economic concerns, while the IRGC declared its forces fully prepared on land, sea and air and US sanctions tightened on Iran's economy targeting individuals and entities. Kataib Hezbollah warned it will target hostile aircraft over Iraq, and Iraq explored military technology at a Washington expo and signed a memorandum of understanding with Morocco to develop security training and qualification. Fuad Hussein reported that Iraq suffered $60 billion in losses due to the war with Iran, and the foreign minister discussed enhanced security and military cooperation with his Italian counterpart. The conflict recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/16/iraq-parliament-approves-al-zaidis-cabinet-amid-growing-economic-concerns&quot;&gt;aljazeera.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNS2JTR3lxbEpuQkdqMzJGcWtIWldEVUl1TnQxc1RGYkxINjZYMnZKYjUzRndXUFBxZmg2U2s4V3p6aC1DS1JOWEJic0p4XzRhWW8tRjZCZnZJV2hNWTMxZ0JrYUhuVGhreXlnWDVSdk9VQVZOd0FPc0JBb3VnQUZNWkRaR0J0dzNsODhr?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;وكالة الانباء العراقية (واع)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxPZWFQSDdiaWg2TXRZUUZlb2JPUG9TT1dKSndxczVMU0JxZGhsNGRuU2dWeXlBbnZmSjJXNHZzUENDU1FjX0dId3dmZENCenNwdnlQa0NXWTRpak13Qi1CSUJpd1NoNWNwa3k3NXZzQ0dfVHlEV0RteUphMUxRRkJpY29VVTljVXhGSEtEcFFoR3FIbTk5NWRVa2ZnWTRKTHpUSUNmMEFMdU5IU0NwdnJGT1p1OElXOGNQOElNWU1BdnVKZmVsN3lN?oc=5&quot;&gt;صوت الإمارات&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiRkFVX3lxTE1rSDZaMkNXTERPNGw0ZldjVWU0Nkk1M01pWXdoTjR5U2NCYjFBQUZUZ0ktQmJ4cEl4T1pzMnlTdTc0SzRWaWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;وزارة الخارجية العراقية&lt;/a&g